   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Carol M. Highsmith (American photographer, 1946-); Mount McKinley, Denali National Park, Alaska, USA; Mount McKinley or Denali ("The Great One") in Alaska is the highest mountain peak in North America, at a height of approximately 20,320 feet (6,194 m) above sea level. It is the centerpiece of Denali National Park.; August 6, 2008; 1 photograph : digital, TIFF file, color.; Gift and purchase; Carol M. Highsmith; 2009; (DLC/PP-2010:031); Forms part of: Carol M. Highsmith's America Project in the Carol M. Highsmith Archive.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
